 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "is the fibration of the graph ",
 StyleBox["total", "TI"],
 " with the projection ",
 StyleBox["proj", "TI"],
 ", an association or a function on the vertices of ",
 StyleBox["total", "TI"],
 ".",
 "\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"5ac4ffff-06ea-4fe5-9737-80ae3e2f572b"],
 Cell[BoxData[
